-- s 970(1)-(2) as a regulative rule: notified on the fifteenth day is in time; a clock that reaches the sixteenth day with no notice is a breach.
#TRACE `s 970(1)-(2) the company's duty to notify the Panel` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY Company DOES `Action of a party` OF Company, `Takeover Panel`, "notify the Panel of the opting-in or opting-out resolution" AT 15

#TRACE `s 970(1)-(2) the company's duty to notify the Panel` AT 0 WITH
    (WAITUNTIL 16)

